{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgkdCzABKPeSmjoj83KK9","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_011qFr1ComdNk6f75XR5JJXP","name":"StructuredOutput","input":{"answer":"I'd open an account at Psagot (the page marks it \"הזול\") and buy the \"אי.בי.אי. מחקה (4A) ת\"א 125\" fund. I didn't change the page's example of 10,000 ₪ now plus 500 ₪ a month, and with that it says I'd end up with about 86,045 ₪ after 10 years. I never put in my own 30,000, so for me the final number would be different.","confidence":"fairly sure","gave_up":false,"stuck":[{"where":"Screen 1–2, amount fields","why":"It already said 10,000 and 500, not my 30,000. The slider for 10,000 looked like it was at the end already, so I just left the page's numbers."},{"where":"Screen 7–8, fund list, '−0.04%' and '−1,030 ₪' next to every fund","why":"Every fund has a minus on it. I couldn't tell if that means losing money. The one marked 'הבחירה' had the smallest minus, so I went with it, but it scared me a bit."},{"where":"Screen 2, '85,015 ₪ / −1,030 ₪ לעומת הבחירה שלכם'","why":"At first I read the minus as losing 1,030 ₪, then I got that the second option just ends up with less."},{"where":"Screen 4, bank list","why":"Leumi, Hapoalim and Discount are names I trust, but they're 3,000–7,000 ₪ worse. Psagot I've heard of, so I was OK with it."}],"used":["Big heading 'איפה ואיך הכי זול להשקיע במדד, לאורך זמן'","The 'ת\"א-125' chip (already selected)","Big number 'הפקדתם 70,000 ₪'","Box 'הבחירה שלכם · הזול' 86,045 ₪ 'נשאר לכם בעוד 10 שנים'","Account card 'פסגות ניירות ערך בע\"מ'","Ranked list of accounts: Psagot 86,045 at #1, Leumi 82,968, the rest lower","Fund card 'אי.בי.אי. מחקה (4A) ת\"א 125', 'דמי ניהול 0.1%'","Fund list, top one marked 'הבחירה'"],"skimmed":["The text under the index heading about how the index is built","Colour bar and legend of costs (tax pink was the biggest)","'העלות אצלכם, לעומת הזוג השני' lines (18 ₪ יותר, 1,390 ₪ פחות, 342 ₪ יותר)","The 'לא בחישוב' special-price notes under each bank","The 'מה הכי משנה את מה שיישאר לכם' chart and its table"],"skipped":["Small text above the account table","Accounts 11–15 and the 'אין נתון' ones (Interactive Brokers etc.)","Explanation paragraph under the fund list ('מול המדד...')","'הוספת קרן שלא ברשימה'","'אינפלציה' button","Screens 10–13: I stopped reading there"],"unsure_meaning":["דמי משמרת","נאמן 0.025%","−0.04% / −0.37% 'בשנה · שנה אחת' next to funds: is that a loss?","מול הבסיס","4A in the fund names","'מחזיקה את המניות' vs 'כמה דרכים יחד' tags","קרן מחקה vs קרן סל: I think they're the same thing","Dotted purple underlines under numbers","'לא בחישוב'"],"not_found":["Where to put my own 30,000 easily: the slider seemed already maxed at 10,000","A plain 'what to do first' step, like a button to open the account","Whether 86,045 is before or after inflation (it says 'בכסף של היום', not sure what that means here)"],"findings":[{"what":"Every fund shows a minus % and a minus ₪ figure. It looks like losing money and nearly put me off all of them","where":"Fund list, screens 7–8"},{"what":"Default amount is 10,000 and the slider seems to stop there, so I can't easily see my 30,000","where":"Screen 1, 'סכום היום'"},{"what":"No clear first step or button telling me to go open the account","where":"After the result box, screen 2–3"},{"what":"Too many banks in a row that look alike; I only really looked at #1","where":"Account list, screens 4–6"},{"what":"Lots of words I don't know (דמי משמרת, נאמן, מול הבסיס) with no simple explanation next to them","where":"Legend and fund card, screens 3 and 7"},{"what":"Long sentence ends at the far left get cut off or missed (e.g. 'מחזיקה את המניות' tag is cut)","where":"Fund list tags, screen 8"}]},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3714,"cache_read_input_tokens":17471,"cache